            "body": "> Mainly an escape hatch until vLLM pins an AITER release with the fix.\r\n\r\nI would push the AITER side fix and wait for that. In the meanwhile you can use `VLLM_ROCM_QUICK_REDUCE_QUANTIZATION=INT6` that still routes to HIP QR.",
